Third-party notice: bundled model license

This MIT license applies to the NeuroVox source code in this repository. It
does NOT apply to the Silero TTS voice model that NeuroVox downloads
separately at first run (see config.py, SILERO_MODELS).

The default voice model (v5_5_ru, downloaded from https://models.silero.ai)
is published by its authors under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International license
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), not MIT. Under that license the model may be used only
for non-commercial purposes. See the full terms at:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

and the upstream project's own license statement at:

    https://github.com/snakers4/silero-models

If you intend to use NeuroVox, or a derivative of it, for a commercial
purpose, you are responsible for either obtaining separate permission from
the Silero team for commercial use of the model, or configuring NeuroVox to
use a differently-licensed model instead.

